  "Length: 16000 <= prompt tokens < 32000 with both the Qwen3-0.6B and the Qwen3-8B tokenizer; the same documents are used for both models.",
  "Order: sha256('longctx_v3:'+rid); the first 21 are taken. All are held-out; nothing here is used for selection or tuning. Held-out traces are collected only after docs/preregistration_v3.md and splits/heldout_frozen_v3.json are committed and pushed."
